1
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:20,600
Help! My dad just collapsed. He's not breathing!

2
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:25,000
Don't panic. 911 CAD dispatch has been alerted
with your exact GPS location.

3
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:28,900
Put heel of hand on center of chest.
Lock your elbows straight.

4
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,600
Ready to compress.

5
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:36,800
Ready: 3... 2... 1... PUSH!
Push hard and fast to the beat!

6
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:40,200
Push down two inches,
let the chest rise fully every time.

7
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:42,800
Did I break his rib?

8
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:47,500
Keep pushing to the beat.
Emergency services will guide you.

9
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:51,000
The paramedics are here!

10
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:04,600
EMS Handoff: adult patient with cardiac arrest.

11
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:08,700
Bystander CPR performed for 1 min 32 sec,

12
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:14,800
approximately 168 compressions delivered at 110 BPM.
Awaiting defibrillation.

13
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:21,700
Three display modes, because a phone on the pavement
has to stay readable in the sun.

14
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:30,500
AssemblyAI hears every word. A deterministic engine decides
what gets said — the model only answers questions, behind a safety gate.

15
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:38,000
Protocol lines answer in twenty milliseconds. Live questions,
in under half a second. And the metronome never stops.
